### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:9999/api/v1/engine/health

### 查看已加载的配置快照
GET http://localhost:9999/api/v1/engine/config/status

### 手动重新加载数据库配置
POST http://localhost:9999/api/v1/engine/config/reload

### 单次策略计算：命中登录异常策略
POST http://localhost:9999/api/v1/engine/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "demo-001",
  "businessKey": "demo_business",
  "sceneKey": "login_protection",
  "needDetail": true,
  "data": {
    "userId": "demo-user",
    "blacklisted": true,
    "login_count": 1,
    "device_risk_score": 0
  }
}

### 批量策略计算（最多100条）
POST http://localhost:9999/api/v1/engine/evaluate/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requests": [
    {
      "requestId": "batch-001",
      "businessKey": "demo_business",
      "sceneKey": "login_protection",
      "data": {"blacklisted": false, "login_count": 8}
    },
    {
      "requestId": "batch-002",
      "businessKey": "demo_business",
      "sceneKey": "register_protection",
      "data": {"register_count": 12, "ip_risk_level": "normal"}
    }
  ]
}
